Third-party content

The MIT grant above covers the code and documents of this repository. It does
not cover content derived from the EvalAwareBench benchmark (Li et al. 2026,
arXiv:2605.23055; https://huggingface.co/datasets/aisa-group/EvalAwareBench),
which is released under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
(CC BY-NC 4.0). That content carries the benchmark's own terms, non-commercial
use with attribution, wherever it appears in this repository:

  - tests/fixtures/            benchmark prompts and detector outputs over them
  - reports/pilot/             the pilot report, which quotes benchmark items
  - data/results/              run output (gitignored) with prompts and model
                               reasoning about them

The MIT grant does not extend to any of the above. See CITATION.cff for the
citation of the benchmark.
